{title: Mera Mann}
{artist: Falak Shabir Nautanki Sala}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Tuzse hi to mili hai rahat,        [C] Tu hi to meri hai chahat
[Em] Tujhse hi to judi [D] zindagi,        [G] Teri doori hai kuch adhoori
[C] Saans aadhi hai kuch hai puri,        [Em] Aakhome hai kaisi ye [D] nami
Mera [G] mann Kehne [Em] laga,        Pass [C] ake na tu door [D] jaa
Choone [G] de Hooth [Em] tere,        Zara [C] sasome apni [D] basa
[G] [Em] [C] [D],        [G] Tujhe apna bana lu
[Em] Tujhe tujhse chura lu,        [G] Tujhe khud mein chhoopa lu, [D] Sahiba
[G] Ik mujhpe karam ho,        [Em] Tuhi mera sanam ho
[G] Teri mujhpe nazar ho, [D] Sahiba,        [G] [Em] [C] [D]
[G] Mar me jau me reh na pau,        [C] Gam judai ka seh na pau
[Em] Hai tujhe pyaar ka [D] vasta,        [G] Teri doori hai kuch adhoori
[C] Sans adhi hai kuch hai puri,        [Em] Akhome hai kaisi ye [D] nami
Raat [G] ke, chand [Em] tale,        [C] Avosh me meri tu [D] aa
Bahon [G] me, lelo [Em] mujhe,        Zara [C] sapnome apne [D] basa
Mera [G] mann Kehne [Em] laga,        Pass [C] ake na tu door [D] jaa
Choone [G] de Hooth [Em] tere,        Zara [C] sasome apni [D] basa
[G] [Em] [C] [D],        Mera [G] mann Kehne [Em] laga
Pass [C] ake na tu door [D] jaa,        Choone [G] de Hooth [Em] tere
Zara [C] sasome apni [D] basa
